---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <section class="min-h-[85vh] flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-white/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl relative reveal">
      <span class="inline-block uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs text-white/70 border border-white/25 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-8 glass">
        Web Design for Clinics
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-8">
        Affordable, Professional<br class="hidden md:block" /> Websites Built for Clinics
      </h1>
      <div class="mx-auto my-8 h-px w-16 bg-white/50"></div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/85 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
        I build completely customised websites for dental practices, physio and GP clinics, aesthetics
        studios and wellness clinics, without the agency price tag. Based in Dublin, working with
        clinics everywhere. No templates, no bloated packages, just a site designed properly around
        your patients.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-white text-brand-500 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/90 transition font-medium">
          Get a Free Quote
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="border border-white/60 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition font-medium glass-hover">
          View Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-white/15">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center glass reveal float">
        <img src="/images/clinic-site-mockup.svg" alt="Mockup of a clinic booking website on a laptop screen" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">Why Work With Me</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl mb-5">Genuinely custom, not just a website</h2>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Plenty of people can build a clinic a website. The real difference is a site designed
          properly around your practice, your patients and your booking flow, built by hand rather
          than bolted together from a template.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you need a simple one-page site or something more sophisticated with appointment
          bookings and online payments, everything is built around what actually fits your clinic.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-brand-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl text-center mb-14 reveal">Clinics I Work With</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center glass-hover reveal">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">Dental &amp; Physio</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">Dental practices and physiotherapy clinics who want an easy booking flow and a site that builds trust before a patient even walks in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center glass-hover reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">GP &amp; Wellness Clinics</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">GP practices and wellness clinics who need clear service pages, opening hours and contact details patients can actually find.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center glass-hover reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">Aesthetics &amp; Therapy</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">Aesthetics studios and therapy clinics who deserve a proper website without agency prices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
